+# Game Asset Forge Run 3 — contact and deformation
+
+Mission: turn the merged Run 2 structural character/rig/contact substrate into real deformation evidence. Do not start another broad architecture phase.
+
+Priority:
+1. Drive the source-grounded 53-joint finger rig into the human-scale rifle contact pose so both hands wrap the weapon instead of stopping at wrist/hand socket contact.
+2. Prove shoulder/elbow/wrist deformation under that same pose and add bounded corrective state only where evidence shows ordinary weighting fails.
+3. Check rigid Sentinel armor clearance against the posed/skinned character and repair component segmentation/clearance without mutating canonical body state.
+4. Preserve Godot A/B evidence and deterministic contact/deformation receipts before promotion.
+
+Quality benchmark: original character capability parity with strong shipped hero-character pipelines. Do not copy proprietary character designs.
+
+Truth boundary: a green structural rig, smaller contact error, or different screenshot is not by itself a quality promotion. Promotion requires the actual posed character to read better in-engine without new clipping or deformation defects.
